### Database Changes
- None

### APIs to Create/Update
- None

### Validation Rules
- Cache must never serve stale data after an admin operation (invalidation is mandatory)
- Feature resolution must handle: no subscription, expired subscription, inactive features
- Must return empty set (not null) for users with no features
- Must handle the case where user has no subscription gracefully

